{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life events and personal accounts of hikers. The narrative has been altered for entertainment purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are thousands of missing reports filed each year in the U.S National Parks. Many cases remain unexplained.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE MAIN CHARACTER OF THE SERIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the events that continue from the first episode and learn more details about the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the mystery of missing hikers in U.S. National Parks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to strange individuals - meet new characters and follow their story through the episodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the FBI man and his assignement.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More interactions than the first episode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve simple puzzles and find your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual driving with a twist!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651020?t=1744266147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651020?t=1744266147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/6e9271c67c7a8de4dfa8f978f5f582ff289d65f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744266147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651020/6e9271c67c7a8de4dfa8f978f5f582ff289d65f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744266147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life 